  "body": "Found while working #2042. The release packages now contain the `examples/` directory. A user cannot yet open an example from the app.\n\nAdd a File menu entry \"Open example\" (plain English). It lists the `.camproj` files of the `examples/` directory beside the executable and opens the chosen one.\n\nThe entry goes through the same open-project command as File > Open. Hide the entry when the directory is missing.\n\nDone means:\n- The File menu lists the example projects of an installed package.\n- A UI test in `crates/ui/tests/` pins the entry.\n",
